    "title": "Shake Shack",
    "description": "The closest you\u2019ll come to downloading a burger and fries: the Shack App!  \r\nWhenever you\u2019re craving really, really good ingredients (always), getting your Shake Shack fix is easier than ever on the app\u2014from delivery to curbside pickup. Plus, enjoy sweet features like early access to new items, exclusive collabs, and way more.   \r\n \r\nSHAKE SHACK APP FEATURES:  \r\n \r\nSKIP THE LINE  \r\no Order ahead from wherever    \r\no Choose your pickup type  \r\no Fast reordering + save your favorites   \r\no Customize your meal + allergy preferences  \r\no Google Pay  \r\n \r\n99\u00a2 DELIVERY  \r\no In-app delivery for just 99\u00a2 \r\no Track your food in real time \r\no Customize your drop-off preferences  \r\n \r\nEXCLUSIVE TREATS \r\no App-only offers \r\no Early access to new items + collabs   \r\no Exclusive regional + seasonal items  \r\no First to hear about all new items \r\n \r\nFollow us on Instagram, Twitter, and Facebook for all the latest Shake Shack news: @shakeshack",
